#. ホ、ホントに…やるの？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A-Are you guys really gonna go through with this?"
msgstr ""

#. …ったりめーだッ！
msgctxt "0002 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Shit yeah!"
msgstr ""

#. どうせ数分で音を上げるに決まってる！
#. 君みたいな連中は口ばかりと相場が決まっているのだ！
msgctxt "0003 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"He'll be done in a matter of minutes, anyway. People\n"
"like him are, without exception, all talk!"
msgstr ""

#. じょーとーだぁ…！
msgctxt "0004 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Bring! It! On!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、<CLT 3>ハンデ<CLT>やんよ！
#. オレが楽勝過ぎてもつまんねーからなぁ！
msgctxt "0005 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Hell, let's <CLT 3>make things interesting<CLT>. Wouldn't wanna\n"
"win without a challenge, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ハンデ…？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Interesting...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“服を着たまま”<CLT>勝負してやんよッ！！
msgctxt "0007 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "We're gonna battle <CLT 3>with all our clothes on<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. バ、バカなッ…！　自殺行為だッ！！
msgctxt "0008 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Th-That's idiotic! Suicidal!"
msgstr ""

#. あんだぁ？　ビビってんのかぁ？
msgctxt "0009 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "What, you afraid?"
msgstr ""

#. こ…後悔するぞ…！
msgctxt "0010 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Y-You're going to regret this!"
msgstr ""

#. るせぇ、勝負だぁぁああ！！
msgctxt "0011 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Shut up and let's do this!"
msgstr ""

#. お、大和田くん…
msgctxt "0012 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "H-Hey, Mondo..."
msgstr ""

#. …んだぁ、コラァ。
msgctxt "0013 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "What, asshole?"
msgstr ""

#. 学ランを脱いでもいいんだぞ…
#. 今なら、笑うだけで許してやろう…
msgctxt "0014 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You can take off your uniform, ya know. Go ahead, I\n"
"won't judge."
msgstr ""

#. …人の心配より、自分の心配したらどうだ？
msgctxt "0015 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"And you can shut the fuck up and mind your own\n"
"business. I mean, look at you."
msgstr ""

#. 顔が真っ赤じゃねーか…
#. 温泉のサルか、テメーは！
msgctxt "0016 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Your face is all red. What're you, one of those\n"
"goddamn hot spring monkeys?"
msgstr ""

#. 顔が赤いのは…生まれつきだ。
msgctxt "0017 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I-It just so happens...I was born with a red face...!"
msgstr ""

#. やせガマンしてんじゃねー…
msgctxt "0018 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "You don't have to act all big, man."
msgstr ""

#. や、やせガマンだとぉ？
msgctxt "0019 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "A-Act, you say?"
msgstr ""

#. ハッハッハ、僕はまだまだ余裕だよ。
#. 鍋焼きうどんでも食べたいくらいだ…！
msgctxt "0020 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! I'm still plenty good to go! I'm so good, I\n"
"could eat a steaming-hot bowl of soup right now!"
msgstr ""

#. だ、大丈夫なのか？　２人とも…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are they...okay?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、そんなボクの心配をよそに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tried to push my concern aside.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>勝負から数分がたち…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A few minutes passed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして数十分になり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then a few dozen minutes...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さらには１時間が経過した…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then an hour...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そろそろ…諦めはら…ほうだ？
msgctxt "0026 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "D-Don't you think...it's about time...you gave up?"
msgstr ""

#. テメェこそ…ろれつが回ってねーぞ…
msgctxt "0027 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "What about you? You can't even hardly talk...dumbass."
msgstr ""

#. ま、何を言ふ…僕はまだまだ余裕ひゃよ。
#. むしろ逆に…寒くなってきたくらいひゃ……
msgctxt "0028 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Say wh-whatever you want...I'm still totally...good to\n"
"go! In fact, I'm starting to feel...kinda cold!"
msgstr ""

#. ヤベーじゃねーか…それ…
msgctxt "0029 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "That's...prolly not good..."
msgstr ""

#. あ、あのさ、２人とも…
#. いつまでも意地の張り合いしてないで…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"H-Hey, uh...guys? I know you both wanna prove how big\n"
"of badasses you are, but..."
msgstr ""

#. そろそろ…いいんじゃない？
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...don't you think you've done enough?"
msgstr ""

#. うるさいッ！！
msgctxt "0032 | ISHIDA"
msgid "Shut up!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ったく、どうなっても知らないぞ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Gah...I just can't win.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー、校内放送でーす。
#. 午後１０時になりました。
msgctxt "0035 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Mm, ahem, this is a school announcement. It is now 10\n"
"p.m."
msgstr ""

#. ただいまより<CLT 3>“夜時間”<CLT>になります。
msgctxt "0036 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "As such, it is officially <CLT 3>nighttime<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 間もなく食堂はドアをロックされますので、
#. 立ち入り禁止となりま～す。
msgctxt "0037 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Soon the doors to the dining hall will be locked, and\n"
"entry at that point is strictly prohibited."
msgstr ""

#. ではでは、いい夢を。おやすみなさい…
msgctxt "0038 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay then...sweet dreams, everyone! Good night, sleep\n"
"tight, don't let the bed bugs bite..."
msgstr ""

#. …ねぇ、聞いた？
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Hey, did you hear that?"
msgstr ""

#. もう夜時間だしさ、勝負は引き分けって事で…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's nighttime. How about we call it a tie?"
msgstr ""

#. 勝負に…引き分けなど存在しなひッ！
msgctxt "0041 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"In a true competition...there's no such thing as a\n"
"tie!"
msgstr ""

#. 勝つか負けるか…ほれだけが大事なのひゃッ！！
msgctxt "0042 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You win, or you lose. That's...the only thing that\n"
"matters!"
msgstr ""

#. テメぇ…言ったな…
#. 言っちゃったなぁ！！
msgctxt "0043 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Listen to you...you son of a bitch...!"
msgstr ""

#. じょーとーだぁ…
#. じ、地獄の果てまで…付き合ってやんよッ！
msgctxt "0044 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Then bring it on...! I'll...I'll push you right up to\n"
"the gates of hell!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>地獄の果てって…
#. そんなトコまで…付き合いきれないよ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The gates of hell...!? That's not a good place to push\n"
"someone!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あのさ、悪いけど…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-This isn't good, guys..."
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、オメェは部屋に戻ってろ！！
msgctxt "0047 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you hear him? Better crawl on back...to your\n"
"room...!"
msgstr ""

#. け、結果は…明日の朝に教えてやる…
#. そこでお前は…オレの伝説を語り継ぐ事になる…
msgctxt "0048 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"I'll let you know how it went...in the morning! Then\n"
"you can start spreading my...my legend...!"
msgstr ""

#. 明日の朝を…楽しみにしててくれたまへ。
msgctxt "0049 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Come tomorrow morning..."
msgstr ""

#. この不良が…僕の足元にひざまずいている所を…
#. お、お見せひよう…
msgctxt "0050 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"...you'll fall down in front of me...down on your\n"
"knees. I'll show you where to do it...!"
msgstr ""

#. よ、よく言うぜ…
#. 今にも限界って顔してるクセによ…
msgctxt "0051 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Big talk from someone...whose face is about to\n"
"explode...!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それは君の方はろうッ！！
msgctxt "0052 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Right back a-at ya!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. じゃあ…おやすみ…
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, well...g'night then."
msgstr ""
